return {
    ["\n　　您的好意一如既往，您的行为让我困惑。\n　　您真的只是可怜我吗？这就是您的心意？\n　　您能至少与我面对面说一次话吗？\n　　……想必这封信也不会收到您的答复，但我会一直在这里，等待着您的出现。\n　　我从未见过春天，我的世界里，只有您来了。"] = "\n	Your kindness is as consistent as ever, yet your behavior confuses me.\n	Are you really just pitying me? Is this your true intention?\n	Can you at least speak to me face-to-face once?\n	...I suppose this letter will not receive a reply from you either, but I will always be here, waiting for your appearance.\n	I have never seen spring; in my world, only you have arrived.",
    ["        我感受过太多不同的气息了，异样的、疯狂的、邪恶的、诡异的……"] = "        I have felt too many different auras—strange, mad, evil, bizarre...",
