    ["<Assistant_Title1>封印物</>\n<Assistant_Title2>系统说明：</>\n你正在使用的封印物，本质上是由某位神秘的“奇迹师”所召唤的<Assistant_Property1>历史投影</>。这种历史投影相较于原版封印物，能力有所弱化，但负面效果也有所减轻，能为非凡者带来各种提升。\n其中，<Assistant_Property1>普通封印物</>分为攻击、防御、特化三种，每类封印物最多携带一件使用；<Assistant_Property2>特殊封印物</>为非凡者提供各种特殊能力，不直接提升非凡者战力。\n1、通过<Assistant_System>菜单-封印物</>或快捷键<Assistant_Property1>F5</>可以进入封印物系统，选择<Assistant_Property2>封印物</>携带。\n2、普通封印物初始均为“3”级，可以消耗<Assistant_Property1>历史回响</>将封印物提升到“2”级；可以消耗<Assistant_Property2>历史结晶</>将封印物提升到“1”级。“3”级封印物最多可生效4条非凡物质词条效果，“2”级封印物最多可生效5条非凡物质词条效果。\n3、扮演等级达到42级时，可解锁<Assistant_Property1>非凡物质</>填充。为封印物填充不同的非凡物质，能为封印物附加上各种额外的效果。\n4、封印物填充非凡物质时，根据非凡物质的词条数量，额外生效<Assistant_Property2>非凡共鸣</>效果，封印物等级提升，会提高非凡共鸣所能生效的最大词条数量。\n5、提升<Assistant_Property1>非凡知识</>等级，能使你更好地掌控非凡之力，封印物非凡能力效果、非凡物质固定属性值与非凡共鸣属性值会随非凡知识等级提升。\n<Assistant_Title3>推荐搜索：</>{SendAnswer:[获取封印物]|1266}，{SendAnswer:[封印物升级]|1267}，{SendAnswer:[非凡物质]|1268}，{SendAnswer:[获取非凡物质]|1269}，{SendAnswer:[非凡物质聚合]|1270}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Sealed Artifact</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Explanation:</>\nThe Sealed Artifact you are currently using is essentially a <Assistant_Property1>historical projection</> summoned by a mysterious \"Miracle Invoker.\" Compared to the original Sealed Artifact, this historical projection has weakened abilities, but its negative effects are also mitigated, providing various enhancements to Beyonders.\nAmong them, <Assistant_Property1>Common Sealed Artifacts</> are divided into Attack, Defense, and Specialization types, with a maximum of one of each type equipped; <Assistant_Property2>Special Sealed Artifacts</> provide Beyonders with various special abilities and do not directly increase combat power.\n1. You can enter the Sealed Artifact system via <Assistant_System>Menu-Sealed Artifact</> or the shortcut <Assistant_Property1>F5</> to select a <Assistant_Property2>Sealed Artifact</> to equip.\n2. Common Sealed Artifacts start at Level 3; you can consume <Assistant_Property1>Historical Echoes</> to upgrade them to Level 2, and consume <Assistant_Property2>Historical Crystals</> to upgrade them to Level 1. Level 3 Sealed Artifacts can have up to 4 Beyonder material effect entries active, while Level 2 Sealed Artifacts can have up to 5.\n3. When your Acting level reaches 42, you can unlock <Assistant_Property1>Beyonder Material</> filling. Filling a Sealed Artifact with different Beyonder materials can grant it various additional effects.\n4. When filling a Sealed Artifact with Beyonder materials, additional <Assistant_Property2>Beyonder Resonance</> effects will take effect based on the number of material entries. Upgrading the Sealed Artifact level increases the maximum number of entries that can be affected by Beyonder Resonance.\n5. Increasing your <Assistant_Property1>Beyonder Knowledge</> level allows you to better control Beyonder powers; the effects of Sealed Artifact Beyonder abilities, fixed attributes of Beyonder materials, and Beyonder Resonance attribute values will increase with your Beyonder Knowledge level.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches:</>{SendAnswer:[Obtain Sealed Artifact]|1266}, {SendAnswer:[Sealed Artifact Upgrade]|1267}, {SendAnswer:[Beyonder Material]|1268}, {SendAnswer:[Obtain Beyonder Material]|1269}, {SendAnswer:[Beyonder Material Aggregation]|1270}",
    ["<P_Heart>（有些好奇）</>用了这个你就能离开金秋湖么？"] = "<P_Heart> (Curious) </> Can you leave Golden Autumn Lake after using this?",
    ["<P_Heart>（这女孩怎么不讲讲价……）</>太贵了！毕竟它看起来距离真正的护身符还很遥远。"] = "<P_Heart> (Why doesn't this girl haggle...) </> Too expensive! After all, it looks like it's still a long way from being a real amulet.",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>手动暂存</>\n可将当前改装方案保存至手动暂存记录中。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>自动暂存</>\n每次进行改装时，会按规则将改装前方案存入自动暂存记录，具体如下：\n若自动暂存记录未满，则方案将直接存入空位；\n若自动暂存记录已满，且方案风尚度<Highlight>高于</>记录中最低风尚度时，则自动替换风尚度最低的记录。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>暂存记录</> \n每条记录将保存一份车辆的<Highlight>改装数据</>，可随时预览并切换，并可在切换后的记录上继续改装。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>记录清除</> \n<Highlight>装配方案</>和<Highlight>封装车辆</>后，会清除车辆携带的所有暂存记录。"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Manual Temporary Storage</>\nYou can save the current modification plan to the manual temporary storage record. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Automatic Temporary Storage</>\nEach time you perform a modification, the pre-modification plan will be stored in the automatic temporary storage record according to the rules, as follows: \nIf the automatic temporary storage record is not full, the plan will be directly stored in an empty slot; \nIf the automatic temporary storage record is full, and the plan's Fashion Value <Highlight>is higher than</> the lowest Fashion Value in the record, it will automatically replace the record with the lowest Fashion Value. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Temporary Storage Record</> \nEach record will save a copy of the vehicle's <Highlight>modification data</>, which can be previewed and switched at any time, and you can continue to modify on the switched record. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Record Clearing</> \n<Highlight>Assembly Plan</> and <Highlight>Encapsulating Vehicle</> will clear all temporary storage records carried by the vehicle.",
